# 10. Complexity cheat sheet

For now, remember this:

| Operation             | Python list |     Complexity |
| --------------------- | ----------- | -------------: |
| Access `arr[i]`       | Yes         |           O(1) |
| Update `arr[i]`       | Yes         |           O(1) |
| `len(arr)`            | Yes         |           O(1) |
| Search `x in arr`     | Yes         |           O(n) |
| `append(x)`           | Yes         | O(1) amortized |
| `pop()` from end      | Yes         |           O(1) |
| Insert at beginning   | Yes         |           O(n) |
| Remove from beginning | Yes         |           O(n) |

Don't memorize the entire table yet. The **important concepts today are access vs search**.

